{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule pulse_div4 (\n    input  wire clk,\n    input  wire rst,\n    input  wire en,\n    output reg  pulse\n);\n\n    reg [1:0] counter;\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (rst) begin\n            counter <= 2'b00;\n            pulse   <= 1'b0;\n        end else if (en) begin\n            pulse   <= (counter == 2'b11);\n            counter <= counter + 2'b01;\n        end else begin\n            pulse <= 1'b0;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
